andful of restaurants. With Dosa Days I am aiming to provide an authentic Anglo-Indian street food experience – superb dosas made from expertly fermented tangy batter, served with rich and flavoursome curry, chutney and dal. As dosas are naturally vegan and gluten free, they offer a delicious option without any compromise on flavour or textur​e.\nLadies tops, trousers, skirts, scarves, and long dresses - and the popular harem trousers.\nHugely popular salad and falafel wraps - a lunchtime favourite amongst Waterloo workers. And they're great value too!\nServing classic Italian cuisine, including lasagna, meatballs and pasta, and homemade salad boxes.\nTaste the flavours from different parts of the Andes!\nHandmade and hand painted products including pottery, cataplanas, lanterns, good luck roosters, chorizo grills, coasters, trivets and bags from Portugal. The bags are made in the Algarve from recycled material and they are all unique so no bag is the same.\nLagniappe is a Trinidad & Tobago inspired food business focused on taking the distinct and exciting flavours and techniques from the islands to inspire and create amazing food, packed with flavour. All the meat and veg used in the dishes are bought fresh every week and the sada and coconut bakes are made fresh every morning.\nTraditional Senegalese street food stall selling whole fish and select cuts of meat served with rice and vegetables.\nFresh food with specially selected Nigerian herbs and spices, combined with over 20 years of cooking and hospitality experience.\nFried Pad Thai dish served in an omlette. Discover the authentic Thai Street Food as it should be - fast and fresh prepared like you would experience in Thailand.\nThe real test of America. try the Philly cheese steaks burger the best in town... Jucy Lucy 100'/. fresh home made.\nTaste of Indonesia, street food style!\nSambel are determined to introduce the vastness and variety of Indonesian food that you never taste before by adding a little twist to them.\nGenerously filled chicken and lamb wraps filled with fresh salad and a multitude of sauces.\nA selection of delicious Thai curries served with rice - green, red and more!","tokens":["Ch","icken"," k","atsu"," burger"," with"," ter","iy","aki"," and"," spicy"," may","o",","," Japanese"," rice"," boxes"," and"," changing"," weekly"," special","s"," such"," as"," spicy"," pulled"," pork"," burgers",".","Private"," cater","ing"," S","ushi",",","S","ash","imi",",","Temp","ra","..","\n","The"," Dog","er"," is"," served"," with"," the"," same"," style"," of"," the"," v","enezuel","an"," street"," food","."," A"," variety"," of"," sau","ces"," including"," Gu","asac","aca",","," Gar","lic"," Sauce"," and"," Bacon"," Sauce",";"," the"," topp","ings"," that"," they"," used"," to"," have",":"," onions",","," white"," cab","ag","ge"," and"," potato"," sticks",";"," and"," the"," perfect"," complement",","," a"," refreshing"," Pap","elon",".","\n","D","os","as"," are"," rarely"," available"," in"," British"," curry"," houses",","," and"," in"," London",","," quality"," dos","as"," are"," only"," on"," the"," menu"," in"," a"," handful"," of"," restaurants","."," With"," D","osa"," Days"," I"," am"," aiming"," to"," provide"," an"," authentic"," Anglo","-","Indian"," street"," food"," experience"," –"," superb"," dos","as"," made"," from"," expert","ly"," fer","mented"," tang","y"," batter",","," served"," with"," rich"," and"," flav","ours","ome"," curry",","," ch","ut","ney"," and"," dal","."," As"," dos","as"," are"," naturally"," vegan"," and"," gluten"," free",","," they"," offer"," a"," delicious"," option"," without"," any"," compromise"," on"," flavour"," or"," text","ur","​","e",".","\n","L","adies"," tops",","," trousers",","," skirts",","," scar","ves",","," and"," long"," dresses"," -"," and"," the"," popular"," ha","rem"," trousers",".","\n","Hug","ely"," popular"," salad"," and"," fal","af","el"," wraps"," -"," a"," lunch","time"," favourite"," amongst",